title: Fix state_traceBlock and state_callRecorded on omni-node --dev chains
doc:
  - audience:
      - Node Dev
      - Node Operator
    description: |
      Use the parachain tracing executor when polkadot-omni-node runs with --dev, registering
      the proof-size recorder needed to replay signed extrinsics on runtimes using
      StorageWeightReclaim. This fixes state_traceBlock failures on those blocks and enables
      state_callRecorded in development mode through the same executor. Tracing now records
      a proof even for runtimes without StorageWeightReclaim, adding CPU and memory cost
      during tracing only; block authoring and import are unchanged.
crates:
  - name: polkadot-omni-node-lib
    bump: patch
